  "name": "Disguise Self",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Light_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You mask your features to appear as someone else.</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-b339b82d-7fff-7e7a-36f4-74bfc0daf8d7\">For </strong><strong>1 hour</strong>,</span> you take the appearance of another person, or any other similarly shaped creature that you desire.</p><p>Your size and body composition must remain the same, but otherwise you can appear how you wish.</p><p>This changes the appearance of your clothes and any gear but cannot affect how you sound or feel to other creatures.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 hours</strong>.</p>",
